                    "a": "Model informal report: Celebration of Independence Day on 14th August at our college\n\nReported by: X.Y.Z, Grade-XI\n\nOn 14th August, our college celebrated Independence Day with great enthusiasm. The programme began at 8:00 a.m. with the flag-hoisting ceremony. The principal hoisted the national flag while the students sang the national anthem. The college building was decorated with flags and lights. Speeches were delivered by the teachers and students on the importance of freedom, and national songs were sung by the students. A quiz competition and a tableau on the Pakistan Movement were also presented. The principal, in his address, said that the students should work hard to make Pakistan a great nation. Sweets were distributed among the students at the end of the programme. It was a memorable day for all of us. (Model answer — fill in your name and college.)",
