                    "a": "Model presentation — Tolerance: Good morning and a warm welcome to you all. I am __________ from grade XI. Today, my topic is Tolerance. My presentation will be in three parts. In the first part, I will explain what tolerance means. Then, in the second part, I will describe why it is needed. Finally, I'll go on to talk about how we can practise it. Now, let's move to the first part. Tolerance means respecting the opinions, beliefs and customs of others, even when they differ from ours. For example, in a country of many religions and languages like Pakistan, tolerance keeps peace in society. To conclude, tolerance is the foundation of a peaceful and happy society. Thank you for listening. (Model answer.)",
