                "a": "(i) z^2 + 81b^2 = z^2 - (9bi)^2 = (z - 9bi)(z + 9bi)\n(ii) p(z) = z^3 + 3z^2 + z - 5\np(1) = 1 + 3 + 1 - 5 = 0\n(z - 1) is a factor\nz^3 + 3z^2 + z - 5 = (z - 1)(z^2 + 4z + 5)\nz^2 + 4z + 5 = 0, z = -2 ± i\n= (z - 1)(z + 2 - i)(z + 2 + i)\n(iii) 4z^2 + 9b^2 = (2z)^2 - (3bi)^2 = (2z - 3bi)(2z + 3bi)\n(iv) p(z) = z^3 + 3z^2 + 4z + 2\np(-1) = -1 + 3 - 4 + 2 = 0\n(z + 1) is a factor\nz^3 + 3z^2 + 4z + 2 = (z + 1)(z^2 + 2z + 2)\nz^2 + 2z + 2 = 0, z = -1 ± i\n= (z + 1)(z + 1 - i)(z + 1 + i)\n(v) p(z) = z^3 - 7z^2 + 19z - 13\np(1) = 1 - 7 + 19 - 13 = 0\n(z - 1) is a factor\nz^3 - 7z^2 + 19z - 13 = (z - 1)(z^2 - 6z + 13)\nz^2 - 6z + 13 = 0, z = 3 ± 2i\n= (z - 1)(z - 3 - 2i)(z - 3 + 2i)\n(vi) p(z) = z^3 + 3z^2 + 19z + 17\np(-1) = -1 + 3 - 19 + 17 = 0\n(z + 1) is a factor\nz^3 + 3z^2 + 19z + 17 = (z + 1)(z^2 + 2z + 17)\nz^2 + 2z + 17 = 0, z = -1 ± 4i\n= (z + 1)(z + 1 - 4i)(z + 1 + 4i)\n(vii) p(z) = z^3 - 3z^2 + 4z - 2\np(1) = 1 - 3 + 4 - 2 = 0\n(z - 1) is a factor\nz^3 - 3z^2 + 4z - 2 = (z - 1)(z^2 - 2z + 2)\nz^2 - 2z + 2 = 0, z = 1 ± i\n= (z - 1)(z - 1 - i)(z - 1 + i)",
