                "a": "(i) C_3 → C_2 + C_3\n[[D]]1,a,b + c;1,b,c + a;1,c,a + b[[/D]] = [[D]]1,a,a + b + c;1,b,a + b + c;1,c,a + b + c[[/D]]\n= (a + b + c) [[D]]1,a,1;1,b,1;1,c,1[[/D]]\n= 0\n(ii) R_2 → R_2 - R_1, R_3 → R_3 - R_2\n[[D]]x + 1,x + 3,x + 5;x + 4,x + 6,x + 8;x + 7,x + 9,x + 11[[/D]] = [[D]]x + 1,x + 3,x + 5;3,3,3;3,3,3[[/D]]\n= 0\n(iii) R_2 → R_2 - R_1, R_3 → R_3 - R_2\n[[D]]x + 1,x + 3,x + 5;x + 4,x + 6,x + 8;x + 7,x + 9,x + 11[[/D]] = [[D]]x + 1,x + 3,x + 5;3,3,3;3,3,3[[/D]]\n= 0\n(iv) C_1 → C_1 - C_2\n[[D]]b + c,a,a;b,c + a,b;c,c,a + b[[/D]] = [[D]]b + c - a,a,a;b - c - a,c + a,b;0,c,a + b[[/D]]\n= (b + c - a)((c + a)(a + b) - bc) - (b - c - a)(a(a + b) - ac)\n= (b + c - a)a(a + b + c) - (b - c - a)a(a + b - c)\n= a((b + c)^2 - a^2) - a((b - c)^2 - a^2)\n= a((b + c)^2 - (b - c)^2)\n= 4abc\n(v) R_1 → R_1 - R_3, R_2 → R_2 - R_3\n[[D]]1 + a,1,1;1,1 + b,1;1,1,1 + c[[/D]] = [[D]]a,0,-c;0,b,-c;1,1,1 + c[[/D]]\n= a(b(1 + c) + c) - c(0 - b)\n= a(b + bc + c) + bc\n= ab + abc + ac + bc\n= abc(1 + 1/a + 1/b + 1/c)\n(vi) [[D]]α,βγ,αβγ;β,γα,αβγ;γ,αβ,αβγ[[/D]] = αβγ [[D]]α,βγ,1;β,γα,1;γ,αβ,1[[/D]]\n= αβγ(α(γα - αβ) - βγ(β - γ) + (αβ^2 - γ^2α))\n= αβγ((γ - β)(α^2 + βγ) + α(β - γ)(β + γ))\n= αβγ(γ - β)(α^2 - αβ - αγ + βγ)\n= αβγ(γ - β)(α - β)(α - γ)\n= αβγ(β - α)(γ - α)(γ - β)\n= [[D]]α,α^2,α^3;β,β^2,β^3;γ,γ^2,γ^3[[/D]]",
