                "a": "(a) |a⃗| = √((-2)^2 + (3)^2 + (-4)^2) = √29\n(b) |-3î + 5ĵ - 6k̂| = √(9 + 25 + 36) = √70\n|2î - 3ĵ + tk̂| = √(4 + 9 + t^2) = √(13 + t^2)\n√70 = √(13 + t^2)\nt^2 = 57\nt = ±√57\n(c) |a⃗| = √((4)^2 + (-5)^2 + (6)^2) = √77\nRequired vector = -5a⃗\n= -20î + 25ĵ - 30k̂\n(d) |a⃗| = √((-2)^2 + (4)^2 + (-6)^2) = √56 = 2√14\na⃗ = |a⃗|(a⃗/|a⃗|)\n= 2√14((-1/√14)î + (2/√14)ĵ - (3/√14)k̂)",
                "q": "(a) Find the magnitude of a vector a⃗ = -2î + 3ĵ - 4k̂.\n(b) Find the value of t if the vectors -3î + 5ĵ - 6k̂ and 2î - 3ĵ + tk̂ have the same magnitude.\n(c) Find the vector whose magnitude is 5 times the length of a⃗ and is in the opposite direction of a⃗ = 4î - 5ĵ + 6k̂.\n(d) Express a⃗ = -2î + 4ĵ - 6k̂ as a product of its magnitude and direction."
