                "a": "Mid-point of CD = ((2 + 4)/2, (7 + 1)/2, (-1 + 2)/2) = (3,4,1/2)\nLength of median = √((3)^2 + (4)^2 + (1/2)^2)\n= √(9 + 16 + 1/4)\n= √101/2",
