                "q": "Select true option.\ni. The unit vector in the direction of r⃗ = 2î + ĵ - k̂ is:\n(a) (1/√6)(2î + ĵ - k̂) (b) √6(2î + ĵ - k̂)\n(c) 6(2î + ĵ - k̂) (d) (1/6)(2î + ĵ - k̂)\nii. The magnitude of a⃗ × b⃗ represents the ________ of a parallelogram with adjacent sides a⃗ and b⃗.\n(a) opposite sides (b) diagonal (c) area (d) volume\niii. The volume of tetrahedron determined by vectors a⃗, b⃗ and c⃗ is:\n(a) [a⃗, b⃗, c⃗] (b) (1/3)[a⃗, b⃗, c⃗] (c) (1/6)[a⃗, b⃗, c⃗] (d) None\niv. a⃗·(b⃗ × c⃗) = ________.\n(a) a⃗.b⃗.c⃗ (b) a⃗ × b⃗ × c⃗ (c) b⃗·(a⃗ × c⃗) (d) (a⃗ × b⃗)·c⃗\nv. If a⃗ and b⃗ are parallel then a⃗·b⃗ = ________\n(a) 1 (b) -1 (c) 0 (d) ab\nvi. If three vectors a⃗, b⃗ and c⃗ are coplanar, then [a⃗ b⃗ c⃗] = ________\n(a) 1 (b) 0 (c) c⃗ (d) a⃗\nvii. Direction cosines of the vector î + ĵ - k̂ are:\n(a) 1/√3, -1/√3, 1/√3 (b) -1/√3, 1/√3, 1/√3\n(c) 1, 1, -1 (d) 1/√3, 1/√3, -1/√3\nviii. a⃗ × b⃗ is ________ to plane of a⃗ and b⃗:\n(a) Parallel (b) Perpendicular (c) Opposite (d) None of these\nix. If a⃗ = P_1P_2⃗, where P_1(0,0,1) and P_2(-3,1,2), then |a⃗| =\n(a) √12 (b) √10 (c) √13 (d) √11\nx. If p⃗ = 4î + 6k̂ and q⃗ = 6î - 4ĵ then |p⃗ - q⃗| is\n(a) √8 (b) 2√14 (c) 2√26 (d) 2√3\nxi. For non-zero vectors a⃗ and b⃗, a⃗ × b⃗ is a unit vector and |a⃗| = |b⃗| = √2, then angle θ between vectors a⃗ and b⃗ is:\n(a) π/2 (b) π/3 (c) π/6 (d) -π/2\nxii. Magnitude of a vector a⃗ = 3î - ĵ + 2k̂ is:\n(a) 13 (b) √12 (c) √14 (d) √11\nxiii. The position vector of the point (1, 0, 2) is:\n(a) î + ĵ + 2k̂ (b) î + 2ĵ (c) 2î + 3k̂ (d) î + 2k̂\nxiv. If O be the origin and OP⃗ = 2î + 3ĵ - 4k̂ and OQ⃗ = 5î + 4ĵ - 3k̂, then PQ⃗ is equal to:\n(a) 7î + 7ĵ - 7k̂ (b) -3î + ĵ - k̂ (c) 3î + ĵ + k̂ (d) -7î - 7ĵ + 7k̂\nxv. k̂ × ĵ = ________.\n(a) î (b) k̂ (c) ĵ (d) -î\nxvi. If |a⃗ × b⃗| = |a⃗·b⃗| then the angle between a⃗ and b⃗:\n(a) 0 (b) π/2 (c) π/4 (d) π\nxvii. The distance of the point (-3,4,5) from the origin is:\n(a) 50 (b) 5√2 (c) 6 (d) None of these\nxviii. The vector having, initial and terminal points as (2, 5, 0) and (-3,7,4) respectively is:\n(a) -î + 12ĵ + 4k̂ (b) -5î + 2ĵ - 4k̂ (c) -5î + 2ĵ + 4k̂ (d) -î + ĵ + k̂\nxix. If |a⃗| = 10, |b⃗| = 2 and a⃗·b⃗ = 0, then the value of |a⃗ × b⃗| is:\n(a) 10 (b) 16 (c) 14 (d) 20\nxx. The number of vectors of unit length perpendicular to the plane of the vectors a⃗ = 2î + ĵ + 2k̂ and b⃗ = ĵ + k̂ is:\n(a) One (b) Two (c) Three (d) Infinite"
