                "a": "[[sin 2θ]/[sin θ]] - [[cos 2θ]/[cos θ]]\n= [[2 sin θ cos θ]/[sin θ]] - [[(2 cos² θ - 1)]/[cos θ]]\n= 2 cos θ - 2 cos θ + [[1]/[cos θ]]\n= sec θ",
