                    "a": "Alpha rays consist of positive charge particles (helium nuclei, He+2). Beta rays consist of negative charge particles (fast moving electrons). Gamma rays are electromagnetic radiations with no charge.",
                    "q": "What are alpha, beta and gamma rays?"
