                    "a": "(c) NH4CN ✓\nNH4CN is formed by the neutralization of a weak acid (HCN) and a weak base (NH4OH).",
                    "q": "(x) Salt formed by neutralization of weak acid and weak base is:\n(a) NH4Cl (b) Na2CO3 (c) NH4CN (d) Na2SO4"
