                    "q": "9. A space station revolves around the earth as a satellite, 100 km above the Earth's surface. What is the net force on an astronaut at rest inside the space station?\n(a) equal to her weight on earth\n(b) a little less than her weight on earth\n(c) less than half her weight on earth\n(d) zero (she is weightless)"
