                    "q": "6. The stream of water emerging from a faucet 'neck down' as it falls. The cross-sectional area is 1.2 cm^2 and 0.35 cm^2. The two levels are separated by a vertical distance of 45 mm as shown in figure. At what rate does water flow from the tap? (34 cm^3 / s)"
