                    "a": "For a parallel-plate capacitor, C = ε_0A/d in vacuum, and C = ε_0ε_rA/d when a dielectric of relative permittivity ε_r fills the space between the plates.",
                    "q": "Write the formula for the capacitance of a parallel-plate capacitor."
