                    "q": "1. A 2200 μF capacitor is charged to a potential difference of 9.0 V then discharged through a 100 kΩ resistor. Calculate (a) the initial charge stored by the capacitor, (b) the time constant of the circuit, (c) calculate the potential difference after a time of 300s equal to the time constant."
