                    "a": "Newton's formula for the speed of sound in a gas is v = √(P/ρ) (isothermal). Laplace corrected it to v = √(γP/ρ) (adiabatic), where γ is the ratio of the specific heats. Laplace's formula gives the correct speed of about 332 m/s in air.",
