                    "a": "i. Practical Uses of AI in Pakistan: Implementation of Learning Management Systems (LMS); Growth of online and virtual classrooms, especially after COVID-19; Use of automated grading systems and digital assessment; Development of career counselling systems based on student performance; Government initiatives promoting digital and AI-based education.\nii. Benefits of AI in Education: Help students learn at their own speed; Support teachers in checking work; Identify students who need extra help; Improve online learning; Support students with disabilities; Help institutions make better decisions using data.\niii. Major Challenges: Limited internet access in many rural areas; Lack of computers and digital devices; Need for teacher training; High cost of AI-based systems; Data privacy and security issues; Risk of overdependence on technology.",
