                    "a": "Reports are structured documents used to present collected data, findings, analysis, and conclusions in a clear and organized way. Digital tools such as Microsoft Word, Google Docs, Canva Docs, Notion, and Adobe Express can help students create well-formatted reports. AI-based tools such as ChatGPT, Microsoft Copilot, Google Gemini, Power BI with Copilot, Tableau AI, and Canva Magic Write can also support report writing by helping students summarize data, improve wording, organize sections, and check grammar. A good report should: start with a clear title, introduction, and purpose of the report; present the collected data using tables, charts, or graphs where needed; explain the main findings in simple and clear language; include conclusions and recommendations based on the data; use AI tools carefully to summarize, organize, and improve the report, but always review the information for accuracy.",
